or halted it after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, the other two still on v2.3.1).\n3. Retried the rollback; it completed successfully across all regions. Verified health afterward.\n4. Opened **SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api documenting the above. The create call timed out, but I confirmed via the incident list that it had been created before retrying, to avoid double-paging on-call.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:** root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}